{"id":"vod_sn_37160","vodId":"37160","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"汤摇庄的幽奈同学","name_cn":"汤摇庄的幽奈同学","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0a058bc294de749e7a05a99a04fab1f8.jpg"},"summary":"冬空凩（小野友树 配音）自幼就有着比一般人强烈的灵感力，常常会遭到幽灵的附身，人生因此一直都不是很顺利，甚至因此而背负上了巨额的债务。无奈之下，冬空凩只得到处寻找容身之处，就这样来到了名为摇曳庄的温泉旅馆之中。　　虽然摇曳庄的所有住客都是女性，但冬空凩最终还是在这里找到了落脚之地。天真可爱的地缚灵汤之花幽奈（岛袋美由利 配音）、每天都沉浸在妄想之中的美少女偶像宫崎千纱希（铃木绘理 配音）、对妖怪感到深恶痛绝的灵能忍者高桥李依（高桥李依 配音）、酒吞童子的后裔荒霸吐吞子（加隈亚衣 配音），和冬空凩住在同一屋檐下的是这些奇奇怪怪的美少女们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6ty10EUhUT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7ZWXi7fNJs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZQze6iZVnX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AuqG0jbKqM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fnw31Lr79s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xknCWJD07Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k9qsVRC2cs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VuVtaRV7xk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BqUpxmmXxF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XXfHjjEphH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XRFxNXRrLw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ayutvLGPrk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VSKUtFNhd91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/85wLAJG2Gf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"h